note Allen-first home controller markup. Reuses the one real #allen-universe canvas and transport.
note Core places door_home before the real Allen artifact and sets #allen data-home-door=true.
note No duplicate scene, synthetic chat, consent coupling or automatic sending.
text sddoor "<section id=\"site-door\" class=\"home-door\" data-allen-intro-defer aria-labelledby=\"site-door-title\" hidden><a id=\"site-door-skip\" class=\"door-skip\" href=\"#allen-input\">Skip introduction</a><div class=\"door-invitation\"><h1 id=\"site-door-title\">Come in.</h1><p id=\"site-door-status\" role=\"status\">Allen's native scene is loading. You can skip it at any time.</p><button id=\"site-door-enter\" type=\"button\" disabled>Enter with sound</button><p class=\"door-note\">Sound begins only when you enter. Escape skips.</p></div></section><section id=\"site-mode-choice\" class=\"site-mode-choice\" aria-label=\"Choose your experience\" hidden><p id=\"site-welcome-copy\" data-speaker=\"allen\">We're trying something new. We're sick of being vibe-coded. Look at this: this is us. This is a new way to interact, inform one another and exchange information: through agents instead of the traditional web interface. If you'd rather have a more traditional experience, you can switch to the classic site anytime.</p><div class=\"site-choice-actions\"><button id=\"site-stay-allen\" type=\"button\">Stay with Allen</button><a href=\"/classic/\" data-site-mode=\"classic\">Classic site</a></div></section><p id=\"site-welcome-status\" class=\"site-welcome-status\" role=\"status\" hidden></p><noscript><style>#allen{display:none!important}body:has(#allen){overflow:auto!important}.site-native{padding:6rem 1.5rem}</style><h1>Sovereign Intelligence, built on AienOS</h1><p>Allen's interactive experience needs JavaScript. The complete site does not.</p><p><a href=\"/classic/\">Open the complete classic site</a></p></noscript>"
text sdtrail "<section id=\"site-trail\" class=\"trail-panel container\" aria-labelledby=\"trail-title\" hidden><details><summary id=\"trail-title\">Your local star map</summary><p>Optional breadcrumbs for this browser only. No account, tracking request or locked content. Nothing is sent to Allen unless you review a message and press Send there.</p><label class=\"trail-opt\"><input id=\"site-trail-enable\" type=\"checkbox\"> Keep my trail on this device</label><p id=\"site-trail-status\" class=\"muted\" role=\"status\">Trail is off.</p><ol id=\"site-trail-list\" class=\"star-map\" aria-label=\"Visited pages\"></ol><div class=\"cluster\"><button id=\"site-trail-clear\" class=\"button button-secondary\" type=\"button\">Clear my trail</button><button id=\"site-trail-report\" class=\"button button-secondary\" type=\"button\">Draft a report to Allen</button></div><div id=\"site-trail-draft\" hidden><label for=\"site-trail-message\">Review your draft</label><textarea id=\"site-trail-message\" rows=\"7\" maxlength=\"2000\"></textarea><p>This draft stays here until you choose the link below. Allen's page opens with an editable message, not a sent message.</p><a id=\"site-trail-send\" class=\"button\" href=\"/allen/\">Take draft to Allen</a><button id=\"site-trail-cancel\" class=\"button button-secondary\" type=\"button\">Cancel draft</button></div></details></section>"
fn door_home to void
sr_raw sddoor
end
fn door_trail to void
sr_raw sdtrail
end
